<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM INDIAN WELLS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM INDIAN WELLS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $2.3 million Champions Cup tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat 12-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 0-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>14-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Sebastien Lareau (Canada) 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat 16-Jim Courier (U.S.) 6-4 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 7- 5 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat Leander Paes (India) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) beat Patrick Rafter (Australia) 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 7-6 (8-6) 6-2</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Vince Spadea (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat Guy Forget (France) 4-6 4-2 retired</p>
<p>Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-4 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 6- 4 6-4</p>
</text>
